    "summary": "Glaido is a voice dictation tool that significantly increases typing speed, allowing users to write five times faster than typing. It captures spoken words in real-time with perfect grammar, saving approximately 20+ hours each month by reducing the time spent on typing. Glaido works seamlessly across various applications, including Gmail, Slack, and ChatGPT, making it universally compatible. It is GDPR compliant, supports over 100 languages, and features a free plan with a limited word count, as well as a Pro plan for unlimited use. Users have reported substantial time savings in their daily workflows, affirming Glaido's effectiveness in both personal and professional settings."
